      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我本想告诉她，这份紧张才是应有的反应，\n毫无坏处——\n但我什么也没说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0744bbd152d3629cddb5ec9fa50c4b4c0beb58b2deae429606719c604e6b1886",
